# Build context of patchbay-web/Dockerfile is the repository root; only the Rust crates and the
# migrations (embedded by patchbay-web/build.rs) are needed.
*
!patchbay-web/Cargo.toml
!patchbay-web/Cargo.lock
!patchbay-web/askama.toml
!patchbay-web/build.rs
!patchbay-web/bin
!db/migrations
!patchbay-web/src
!patchbay-web/templates
!patchbay-web/static
!patchbay-notify/Cargo.toml
!patchbay-notify/src
